<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Need You Around</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">grentperez</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Backflips in a Restaurant</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1q0InfGwHKTEYIHrYxh95Z</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.169" end="00:17.075">Taking time off work to destress</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.075" end="00:21.122">I'll call you on the phone, come over on the express</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.122" end="00:26.440">I promise to pay your toll fee, just promise you'll come to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.440" end="00:32.983">I hope that you know I'm sorry, but I need you here, baby</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.983" end="00:38.405">I thought to watch a movie instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.405" end="00:43.145">And hide up well inside the comfort of my bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.145" end="00:48.390">Oh, maybe we'll get all comfy, we'll fall off into our sleep</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.390" end="00:53.911">As long as I'm near you honey, I'm happy as I can be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.911" end="00:55.411" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.136" end="00:57.806">Never felt to help me get up and down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.806" end="00:59.563">Get me through my Mondays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.563" end="01:03.403">You love me, tease me, keep me dancing around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.403" end="01:05.083">Don't you leave me one day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.083" end="01:10.229">Now, oh-woah, oh-woah, I need you around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.229" end="01:17.241">Oh-woah, oh-woah, I need you around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.241" end="01:18.741" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.255" end="01:23.484">Oh-woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.484" end="01:26.672">Oh-woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.672" end="01:28.172" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.984" end="01:32.117">If you need something though, I'll be there</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.117" end="01:37.103">I'll walk along this road and more to show you that I care</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.103" end="01:39.592">There's nothing that could come between (Nothing that could come between)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.592" end="01:43.221">What we have with you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.221" end="01:45.601">So don't you worry 'bout a thing (Don't you worry 'bout a thing)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.601" end="01:48.761">For once in my life I'm sure that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.761" end="01:50.261" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.959" end="01:52.147">Never felt to help me get up and down</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.147" end="01:54.144">Get me through my Mondays</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.144" end="01:57.832">You love me, tease me, keep me dancing around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.832" end="01:59.332">Don't you leave me one day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.330" end="02:04.767">Now, oh-woah, oh-woah, I need you around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.767" end="02:11.627">Oh-woah, oh-woah, I need you around</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.627" end="02:13.127" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.737" end="02:18.316">Oh-woah, woah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.316" end="02:22.316">Oh-woah</p></div></body></tt>